From eb1618b7f4eadc99adb44d963f155172eed3ed1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:53:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] refactor(server): event table and hello split, the roll
 path in stages, route and db complexity
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

R1.3.8: the hello is applyHello, its writes in today's order; what the campaign keeps of its
features is pure helloCampaignData and helloCompanionData (src/utils/hello-features.ts, with
HELLO_ROLL_FLAGS in the stored order and kindOn for the seven switches), spread into the same
update in the same key order; VERSION_SILENT names the events that leave the version alone.
apply keeps its switch, now well under 15: a handler table keyed by event type would need a
cast at each call, as TypeScript can't tie a key to its handler's event, and would remove no
copy (round.md §0.2.4).

R1.3.9: createRollRequest in stages: rollGate (the pure 409/422 gates, lacksFeature for the
features a roll asks for), readRollContext (the eleven reads, same Promise.all order and args),
rollRefusal, rollPayload and holdCommand.

R1.3.10: the events POST reads its envelope (readEnvelope), then pingAnswer, malformed,
takeEvent and eventAnswer; the commands POST hands a found campaign to commandsFor, claimAll and
holdForCommands. FEATURES and ANSWERED_WITH_FEATURES move to src/constants/features.ts, key
order kept. Route files still export only their methods, OPTIONS and maxDuration.

R1.3.11: extract-function only, each now under 15: getTableView (viewerOf, ownCompanions,
readTable, gmRollParts, seatAllows), messageLabel (rollLabel), expand (choicesBack, fillDefaults,
choiceBack, planBack, actionsBack, actionBack), checkWildShape (by op), findEventCampaign
(recordNotSetUp), applyJournalUpdated (listedIn, mirrorPages), recordNoteResult (mirrorMade),
getGroupView (partyMoves, tooLarge), checkEnds (checkMover, playerMover) and, last, db/notes.ts's
overlay (by state), viewOf (chapterView, entryView), fits (chapterKnown, bookCounts) and
changeNote (changeStanding). Every query, write and key order is as it was.

R1.3.13: attempt moves to src/lib/attempt.ts, so src/db no longer imports src/lib/routes;
db/companions' unused re-export of companionRoster goes.

L1 (l1/S/c11b, on this tree over a2332a2 with commits 9 and 10): jest 306 suites, 9698 tests,
0 red; typegen, tsc 0 errors; eslint 0 errors, 608 warnings; gates 1-12 ok (gate 9 608 against
981, gate 12 two cycle groups, base four).

